        "source": "`codeops/features/blend65-ri/00-roadmap.md`"
      },
      {
        "capability": "Direct hardware I/O (VIC-II / SID / CIA via `peek`/`poke`), raster IRQ via `pokew($0314,&fn)`, bank switching",
        "state": "**Shipping**",
        "source": "`spec/12-intrinsics.md`"
      },
      {
        "capability": "**Phase B optimizer** (IL passes + peephole)",
        "state": "**Not started** — deliberately after RD-18",
        "source": "RD-18 §Won't Have"
      },
      {
        "capability": "**Indirect calls / function pointers** (`FUT-003`) — call a routine at a runtime/absolute address, jump tables",
        "state": "**Deferred, unscheduled**",
